        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Increase Timeout for Push Notifications]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/DominoMFA/MFA/issues/2</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/DominoMFA/MFA/issues/2"/>
        <updated>2026-04-02T08:03:35.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24532731?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/rat-moonshine/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/rat-moonshine">@rat-moonshine</a> requested that we increase the timeout for authentication by push notification to 60 seconds.  The current timeout has been a problem for him in some cases.</p>
<p dir="auto"><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/dpastov/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dpastov">@dpastov</a> reported that the default recommended by his library was 30 seconds.  This is hard-coded now.Some sources that <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MarkProminic/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MarkProminic">@MarkProminic</a> found:<br>
<a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#:~:text=Table_content:%20header:%20%7C%20Title%20%7C%20TOTP:%20Time%2DBased,Pei%20%2C%20Salah%20Machani%20Email%20authors%20%7C" rel="nofollow">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#:~:text=Table_content:%20header:%20%7C%20Title%20%7C%20TOTP:%20Time%2DBased,Pei%20%2C%20Salah%20Machani%20Email%20authors%20%7C</a><br>
<a href="https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2025/03/towards-a-test-suite-for-totp-codes/" rel="nofollow">https://shkspr.mobi/blog/2025/03/towards-a-test-suite-for-totp-codes/</a><br>
<a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#section-5.2" rel="nofollow">https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6238#section-5.2</a></p>
<p dir="auto">We would like official approval from <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/JustinProminic/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/JustinProminic">@JustinProminic</a> if we want to proceed with this, since it is potentially a security concern.</p>
<p dir="auto">Do we want to make this configurable?   If so, we should clearly document the recommendations.</p>]]></content>
        <author>
            <name>JoelProminic</name>
            <email>JoelProminic@noreply.github.com</email>
            <uri>https://github.com/JoelProminic</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2026-04-01T18:18:58.000Z</published>
    </entry>
